WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:05.530
The Marvel Cinematic Universe is an immensely
complex shared universe full of stories but

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:11.639
even amid all that complexity, the story of
Steve Rogers, a.k.a. Captain America, is particularly

00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:12.639
twisty.

00:00:12.639 --> 00:00:15.199
Luckily for you, we're here to make sense
of it all.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.040
This is Captain America's whole timey wimey
MCU story, explained.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.760
Steve Rogers was born in New York City in
1918.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:28.500
By the time he reached adulthood, he was an
orphan, and relied instead on his chosen family

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.210
his best friend, James Buchanan "Bucky" Barnes.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:36.510
By 1943, as World War II raged in Europe,
both Steve and Bucky were trying to enlist

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:37.829
in the U.S. Army.

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:42.630
While Bucky was accepted, Steve's multiple
chronic illnesses and small stature led to

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:47.750
constant rejection, even when he attempted
to use fake names and addresses to enlist.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.500
Steve's luck changed when he met Dr. Abraham
Erskine, the head scientist in

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:56.100
an experimental program called "Project Rebirth,"
which aimed to create a "Super Soldier" to

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.710
help turn the tide of the war for the Allies.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:03.230
Steve was accepted into the program on a trial
basis, and his courage impressed one of the

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:07.580
program's supervisors, a British officer in
the Strategic Scientific Reserve named Peggy

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.630
Carter.

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:12.140
Others in the program remained unconvinced
that Rogers was the man for the job.

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:14.750
Then came the moment that put Rogers over
the top.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:18.710
In an effort to prove that one of the stronger
soldiers would be better suited to the procedure,

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:22.280
SSR Colonel Phillips threw a dummy grenade
on the ground at camp.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.440
"Get away!

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:27.960
Get back!"

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:29.750
and that settled the matter.

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.840
Steve Rogers would be the man to take Erskine's
Super Soldier Serum.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:38.670
Steve Rogers was driven back to New York City
to take part in the Project Rebirth procedure

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.640
under Erskine's supervision.

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:45.100
The night before, Erskine warned him of previous
attempts that hadn't gone well, including

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:50.070
one on a German officer named Johann Schmidt
who was at that very moment pursuing his own

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:54.640
ambitions in Europe as the leader of the fascist
organization known as HYDRA.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:59.150
Though extremely painful, Rogers' version
of the procedure went smoothly; he emerged

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:03.340
with a dramatic increase in height and muscle
mass, boasting enhanced abilities and free

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:05.530
of his previous chronic illnesses.

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:10.310
Rogers' first encounter with HYDRA sadly arrived
just moments after the procedure, as a HYDRA

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:13.010
agent snuck into the room and gunned down
Erskine.

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:17.230
Steve was able to pursue and catch the agent,
but he took his own life before he could be

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:18.230
questioned.

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:23.060
Erskine's death changed the course of the
SSR and Project Rebirth, as his formula apparently

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.230
died with him.

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:28.660
With only one super soldier at their disposal,
the U.S. government pressed Steve Rogers into

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:32.040
service immediately, but it wasn't the kind
of service he wanted.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:36.840
Captain America was viewed by Congress as
more important to the war effort as a symbol

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:41.600
than he was as a soldier, so Steve Rogers
was dressed in a colorful costume and sent

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:46.010
on a tour throughout the United States to
sell war bonds, followed by a tour of Europe

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:47.610
to increase morale for the troops.

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:49.370
"Series E Defense Bonds.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:53.370
Each one you buy is a bullet in the barrel
of your best guy's gun!"

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:58.980
After spending the rest of 1943 doing shows
instead of fighting battles, Steve grew weary,

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:00.690
and then saw his chance to fight.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:05.650
In Italy, he learned that Bucky's unit was
MIA, and opted to stage a one-man rescue mission

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:06.650
for his friend.

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:10.770
With the help of Carter and industrialist
Howard Stark, he dropped behind enemy lines

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:15.480
and rescued Bucky and a number of other troops,
proving himself as a front line asset in the

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:16.980
fight against HYDRA.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:21.310
He also met Schmidt, who revealed his own
encounter with the super soldier process had

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.330
transformed him into the Red Skull.

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:27.650
In an effort to clear out HYDRA and disrupt
its operations, Steve recruited a crack team

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:32.310
of commandos, including Barnes and Dum Dum
Dugan, and they began a series of missions

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:38.100
throughout 1944 to infiltrate HYDRA bases
and rescue captured Allied soldiers and the

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:40.280
legend of Captain America grew.

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:45.920
By 1945, Captain America and his "Howlin'
Commandos" had succeeded in helping turn the

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.879
tide of the war, but it came at great cost.

00:03:48.879 --> 00:03:53.810
During a mission to capture the Red Skull's
chief aide Arnim Zola, Bucky fell to his apparent

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:58.640
death, leaving Steve and the rest of the Commandos
to gain the location of HYDRA's final stronghold

00:03:58.640 --> 00:03:59.799
from Zola.

00:03:59.799 --> 00:04:02.080
Steve then discovered Red Skull's endgame.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:06.530
Using a powerful artifact called the Tesseract
later revealed as an Infinity Stone Schmidt

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:10.620
engineered weapons of mass destruction which
he planned to drop on America with the help

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.450
of a long-distance bomber.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:16.530
Steve snuck onboard the plane and, in the
ensuing confrontation, Red Skull seemingly

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:19.759
died when the unshielded Tesseract pulled
him through a wormhole.

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:23.830
The Tesseract then fell into the ocean, to
later be recovered by Howard Stark.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:28.139
With HYDRA defeated, Steve was left alone
on the damaged plane, and realized he couldn't

00:04:28.139 --> 00:04:32.629
risk landing it because there was a chance
the weapons would detonate and kill countless

00:04:32.629 --> 00:04:33.629
civilians.

00:04:33.629 --> 00:04:37.050
While radioing with Peggy who he'd recently
shared his first kiss with Steve revealed

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:41.699
his intention to crash the plane into the
ocean and sacrifice himself.

00:04:41.699 --> 00:04:43.110
"Peggy…"

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:45.930
"I'm here."

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:50.539
"...I'm gonna need a raincheck on that dance."

00:04:50.539 --> 00:04:55.409
So, near the end of World War II, Steve Rogers
flew a plane into the Arctic Ocean and passed

00:04:55.409 --> 00:04:59.819
into legend, becoming an American hero who,
as far as the rest of the world knew, gave

00:04:59.819 --> 00:05:01.669
his life to save countless others.

00:05:02.719 --> 00:05:06.889
In the years following his apparent death,
Captain America became a national symbol of

00:05:06.889 --> 00:05:10.779
heroism, spawning everything from trading
cards to museum exhibits.

00:05:10.779 --> 00:05:15.331
Peggy Carter went on to co-found S.H.I.E.L.D.
and later married and started a family, with

00:05:15.331 --> 00:05:19.689
Steve always alive in her memory, and it was
S.H.I.E.L.D. which continued to hold out hope

00:05:19.689 --> 00:05:21.319
to at least discover his body.

00:05:21.319 --> 00:05:24.779
At last, in the early 2010s, a breakthrough
happened.

00:05:24.779 --> 00:05:25.779
S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:05:25.779 --> 00:05:30.190
scientists searching in the Arctic uncovered
the aircraft and Rogers' intact, frozen body,

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:34.669
then discovered to their amazement that Steve
was somehow still alive, having been frozen

00:05:34.669 --> 00:05:36.059
in time by the ice.

00:05:36.059 --> 00:05:40.149
At first, S.H.I.E.L.D. director Nick Fury
tried to keep Steve unaware that he'd been

00:05:40.149 --> 00:05:45.879
in stasis for nearly seven decades, constructing
a 1940s-era hospital room and even playing

00:05:45.879 --> 00:05:50.729
1940s baseball games on the radio, until one
day he heard a game on the radio that he knew

00:05:50.729 --> 00:05:52.139
had already been played.

00:05:52.139 --> 00:05:57.310
His deception revealed, Fury appeared to Steve
and revealed the truth: It was 2011, and he

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:01.369
would have to adjust to life in a new world,
because he might need to save it again someday

00:06:01.369 --> 00:06:02.360
very soon.

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:07.440
In 2012, Rogers was called back into action
when the Tesseract, which had been in S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:06:07.449 --> 00:06:11.919
custody for years, fell into the hands of
Thor's brother Loki, who planned to use it

00:06:11.919 --> 00:06:15.139
to open a wormhole and summon an alien army
to Earth.

00:06:15.139 --> 00:06:17.599
At Fury's urging and working alongside S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:06:17.599 --> 00:06:22.680
agent and Captain America superfan Phil Coulson,
Steve teamed up with Iron Man a.k.a. Tony

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:25.819
Stark Bruce Banner and his alter-ego The Hulk,
and Thor.

00:06:25.819 --> 00:06:31.240
Rounding out the team were S.H.I.E.L.D. operatives
Black Widow and Hawkeye a.k.a. Natasha Romanoff

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.030
and Clint Barton, respectively.

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:34.810
The group was dubbed The Avengers.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:39.339
The team's relationship was rocky at first
amid a clash of personalities, but Coulson's

00:06:39.339 --> 00:06:43.780
death at Loki's hand galvanized them, and
Steve in particular took point as a field

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.069
captain for the group.

00:06:45.069 --> 00:06:49.509
When Loki used Stark Tower to open his wormhole
over New York City, the Avengers took to the

00:06:49.509 --> 00:06:54.279
streets to fight the ensuing alien Chitauri
invasion, with Steve often taking point in

00:06:54.279 --> 00:06:56.210
getting civilians away from danger.

00:06:56.210 --> 00:07:01.199
In the chaos, the World Security Council opted
to bomb New York rather than risk the invasion

00:07:01.199 --> 00:07:05.649
spreading, but Stark was able to divert the
missile while Romanoff closed the wormhole.

00:07:05.649 --> 00:07:10.520
After Stark narrowly escaped death, the Avengers
took Loki and the Tesseract into custody,

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.569
sending both back to Asgard with Thor.

00:07:12.569 --> 00:07:16.520
Their mission complete, the Avengers went
their separate ways, and Steve became a full-time

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:18.560
S.H.I.E.L.D. field operative.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:23.800
Working closely with both Fury and Romanoff,
Steve remained an active S.H.I.E.L.D. operative

00:07:23.801 --> 00:07:27.930
for the next two years, pouring himself into
his work even as he tried to learn as much

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:30.020
as he could about this new era.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:34.759
Everything changed when, after growing suspicious
about data recovered by Romanoff on a mission,

00:07:34.759 --> 00:07:38.330
Fury was nearly killed by an assassin known
as the Winter Soldier.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:42.069
Working while on the run from an internal
faction seeking to destroy them, Rogers and

00:07:42.069 --> 00:07:46.379
Romanoff uncovered the truth: HYDRA had managed
to infiltrate S.H.I.E.L.D. and had been working

00:07:46.379 --> 00:07:47.960
as a sleeper cell for years.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:55.110
"The new Hydra grew, a beautiful parasite
inside SHIELD."

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.680
Fury was attacked because he and Romanoff
had found data that would compromise HYDRA's

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.339
plan to use S.H.I.E.L.D. assets to kill millions.

00:08:01.339 --> 00:08:06.119
Then there was the bigger secret: Bucky had
been kept in stasis for decades, brainwashed,

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:09.880
and given his own super soldier treatment,
making him the Winter Soldier.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.480
“Bucky?”

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.559
“Who the hell is Bucky?”

00:08:15.559 --> 00:08:20.669
In the ensuing battle, Steve, Romanoff, Fury,
and Falcon a.k.a. Sam Wilson were able to

00:08:20.669 --> 00:08:24.179
expose HYDRA and stop its planned attack at
the last moment.

00:08:24.179 --> 00:08:28.669
Bucky escaped in the chaos after Steve refused
to kill him, but not before sparing and then

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:33.120
saving Steve's life and gaining a new curiosity
about who he really was.

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:38.599
With S.H.I.E.L.D. in ruins following the HYDRA
discovery, Rogers re-teamed with the Avengers

00:08:38.599 --> 00:08:43.639
to take out the remaining HYDRA cells now
under the command of Baron Wolfgang von Strucker.

00:08:43.639 --> 00:08:48.620
While infiltrating the last HYDRA stronghold
in Europe, the team discovered two new metahumans

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:53.680
Pietro and Wanda Maximoff who'd gained their
abilities through Strucker's experiments.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:58.149
After defeating Strucker, the Avengers faced
a new threat when Stark's experimental AI

00:08:58.149 --> 00:09:03.709
technology known as Ultron gained sentience
and began formulating a plan to wipe out humanity.

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:08.570
To make a long story short, Ultron crippled
the Avengers by having Wanda use her mind-bendy

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:12.430
powers to distract, hypnotize, and otherwise
splinter the team.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:17.730
As a result, a rift formed between Stark and
Rogers as Steve questioned Tony's motives

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:21.320
in trying to build what Tony called "a suit
of armor around the world."

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:25.600
"Every time someone tries to win a war before
it starts, innocent people die.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.600
Every time."

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:31.240
The Avengers regrouped in Sokovia, where Ultron
attempted to launch an entire city into the

00:09:31.259 --> 00:09:34.440
sky before dropping it back to Earth like
an asteroid.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:38.709
With the help of the Maximoffs and Ultron's
own android creation Vision, and with Rogers

00:09:38.709 --> 00:09:43.379
again acting as field commander, the team
was able to defeat Ultron's robotic army and

00:09:43.379 --> 00:09:47.770
prevent the city from impacting Earth, losing
Pietro who gave his life to save Clint in

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:48.770
the process.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:52.860
With Ultron defeated, the original Avengers
went their separate ways, so much so that

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.779
Hulk fled the planet in a Quinjet.

00:09:54.779 --> 00:09:58.920
Rogers took command at the team's new upstate
New York facility, and prepared to train a

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:04.300
new team of Avengers with Romanoff including
Wanda, Sam, James "Rhodey" Rhodes better known

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:06.240
as War Machine and Vision.

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:09.680
In 2016, Steve met two new challenges.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:14.220
The first came after an operation by his new
Avengers team caused civilian casualties,

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:19.180
leading a number of nations to come together
and establish the Sokovia Accords, a new system

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:22.160
of regulations to keep superpowered heroes
in check.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:26.720
Stark, believing the Accords were a necessary
way to save innocent lives, stood by the new

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:29.670
policy, while Rogers stood in opposition,
believing that

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:32.279
" … The safest hands are still our own."

00:10:32.279 --> 00:10:36.769
The conflict was complicated by the re-emergence
of Bucky Barnes, who could still be triggered

00:10:36.769 --> 00:10:38.800
by various brainwashing codewords.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:43.420
These codewords fell into the hands of Helmut
Zemo, who launched a plan to bring down the

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:49.120
Avengers from the inside, using Barnes' assassination
of Howard and Maria Stark in 1991 as the fulcrum

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.120
point.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:53.830
To make matters even worse for Good ol' Cap,
Peggy Carter whom Steve had visited on her

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:58.769
deathbed around the same time that he was
reunited with Bucky passed away, dealing another

00:10:58.769 --> 00:11:01.730
emotionally draining blow to the typically
stoic hero.

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:06.709
Rising tensions finally culminated in a physical
battle between Stark and his loyal Avengers

00:11:06.709 --> 00:11:08.410
and Rogers and his own squad.

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:13.050
The battle continued at a secret HYDRA facility
in Siberia, where Stark learned that Barnes

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.360
had killed his parents.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:19.120
Bucky and Steve fought Tony in a vicious battle
before escaping, permanently fracturing the

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.120
Avengers.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:23.750
Steve took Bucky to Wakanda in an effort to
finally remove his Winter Soldier conditioning,

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:28.970
and began performing covert operations with
Natasha, Wanda, and Sam as a fugitive from

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.279
the U.S. government.

00:11:30.279 --> 00:11:34.589
In an act of friendship, Steve left behind
a letter and a cell phone so Tony could call

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:36.440
him if the need ever arose.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:41.360
More than a year passed as Steve and his team
continued to carry out covert operations around

00:11:41.379 --> 00:11:45.920
the world, but their time in hiding was interrupted
when they had to rescue unlikely lovebirds

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:49.529
Wanda and Vision from a pair of alien invaders
in Scotland.

00:11:49.529 --> 00:11:53.689
This was followed by a call from a returned
Bruce Banner, who revealed to Steve that Thanos

00:11:53.689 --> 00:11:58.100
had begun his final push for the Infinity
Stones, threatening all life in the universe.

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:01.769
Vision, who held the Mind Stone in his head,
offered his life if it meant the stone would

00:12:01.769 --> 00:12:05.120
be destroyed and Thanos would be stopped,
but Steve refused.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:09.399
While Tony carried out his own fight with
Thanos off-planet, Steve called in a favor

00:12:09.399 --> 00:12:14.550
to King T'Challa of Wakanda, and the two prepared
for a pitched battle in the secluded African

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.550
nation.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:19.370
Thanos' army arrived in a push to get the
Mind Stone, and Steve led the charge to hold

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:24.019
them off while Wakandan scientist Shuri tried
to remove the Stone from Vision so it could

00:12:24.019 --> 00:12:25.019
be destroyed.

00:12:25.019 --> 00:12:29.160
Though Thor, Groot, and Rocket arrived to
reinforce their fight, Thanos himself later

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.850
appeared to take the Stone.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:35.600
Wanda used her power to destroy it, but Thanos
used the Time Stone to rewind time and take

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.459
the Mind Stone from Vision's head.

00:12:37.459 --> 00:12:42.410
Though Thor nearly killed Thanos, Thanos snapped
his fingers wielding all six Infinity Stones,

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:44.560
wiping out half of all life in the universe.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:49.360
Three weeks after the battle in Wakanda, Steve
and a team of Avengers were shocked by the

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:53.730
return of Tony Stark and the appearance of
Carol Danvers, Captain Marvel.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:57.519
Together they learned that Thanos had used
the Stones again on a distant planet, and

00:12:57.519 --> 00:13:00.060
Steve led a team to go there and take the
Stones back.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:04.139
When they arrived, they found that Thanos
had used the Stones to destroy the Stones,

00:13:04.139 --> 00:13:05.930
rendering their efforts useless.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.970
Thor beheaded Thanos in a rage, and the team
returned home.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:13.149
Five years passed, during which time Steve
did his best to be a help to others in a world

00:13:13.149 --> 00:13:14.709
decimated by Thanos.

00:13:14.709 --> 00:13:17.740
"You did the hardest part you took the jump,
you didn't know where you were gonna come

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:18.740
down.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:23.810
And that's it: that's those little brave baby
steps we've got to take."

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:27.600
While Natasha led field operations for the
remaining Avengers, Steve spent much of his

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:32.529
time in New York City, attending support groups
for survivors and trying to keep morale up

00:13:32.529 --> 00:13:36.579
while acknowledging that he himself was having
trouble moving on from defeat.

00:13:36.579 --> 00:13:40.350
Everything changed when Scott Lang, Ant-Man,
re-emerged after being lost in the Quantum

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:44.959
Realm, and revealed to Steve and Natasha that
time travel could be a possible solution to

00:13:44.959 --> 00:13:46.230
undoing Thanos' harm.

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:51.139
They approached Stark, who was at first reluctant
to help but, after cracking the time travel

00:13:51.139 --> 00:13:55.800
problem, returned to the Avengers facility
to launch a mission to retrieve the Stones.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:14:01.120
Using Pym Particles as their time travel fuel,
the Avengers split into teams to journey back

00:14:01.139 --> 00:14:05.899
to previous encounters with the Infinity Stones
in order to steal them and form a Gauntlet

00:14:05.899 --> 00:14:08.589
of their own that would undo Thanos' snap.

00:14:08.589 --> 00:14:13.509
Steve journeyed with Stark, Banner, and Lang
to New York in 2012, and successfully recovered

00:14:13.509 --> 00:14:16.509
the Mind Stone after a battle with his own
past self.

00:14:16.509 --> 00:14:20.509
Since the Space Stone was lost after it fell
into Loki's hands, Tony and Steve needed to

00:14:20.509 --> 00:14:26.240
launch an unplanned journey to 1970 New Jersey
to recover it at a secret S.H.I.E.L.D. facility.

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:29.600
While there, Steve stole Pym Particles to
facilitate the trip home.

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:33.819
Though Natasha was lost during her mission
to capture the Mind Stone, the Avengers succeeded

00:14:33.819 --> 00:14:39.079
in getting all six Infinity Stones, and Banner
now a sort of Bruce/Hulk hybrid snapped to

00:14:39.079 --> 00:14:40.079
undo the decimation.

00:14:40.079 --> 00:14:45.131
It worked, but moments later a past version
of Thanos arrived, having learned of the Avengers'

00:14:45.131 --> 00:14:47.209
plan via Nebula's memory banks.

00:14:47.209 --> 00:14:52.160
A battle ensued in upstate New York, and at
one point Steve was the last soldier standing.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:56.759
He proved himself worthy of wielding Mjolnir
and led the reformed Avengers in a massive

00:14:56.759 --> 00:15:01.620
fight which culminated in Tony sacrificing
himself by wielding the Stones and using them

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:06.300
to kill Thanos and his entire army, ending
the Infinity War once and for all.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:11.760
With Thanos defeated, it was important that
the Avengers return the Infinity Stones to

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:16.339
the exact places where they took them to prevent
disastrous alternate timelines from continuing

00:15:16.339 --> 00:15:19.040
and disrupting the flow of time in general.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:23.080
Steve took this responsibility on himself,
and had a conversation with Bucky about his

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.540
plans before leaving.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:28.530
After Tony's funeral, Steve stepped back on
the time platform and returned the stones

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.329
to their previous locations.

00:15:30.329 --> 00:15:34.999
Steve was only supposed to be gone for a matter
of seconds for the Avengers in 2023, but he

00:15:34.999 --> 00:15:35.999
missed his timestamp.

00:15:35.999 --> 00:15:37.079
"Where is he?"

00:15:37.079 --> 00:15:39.579
"I dunno — he blew right by his timestamp."

00:15:39.579 --> 00:15:43.749
Steve had saved extra Pym Particles to use
after returning the Stones, and used them

00:15:43.749 --> 00:15:48.509
to travel back to the 1940s to reunite with
Peggy Carter and live out the rest of his

00:15:48.509 --> 00:15:49.689
life in peace with her.

00:15:49.689 --> 00:15:54.879
He didn't reveal himself to the Avengers again
until moments after he left them in 2023,

00:15:54.879 --> 00:15:59.329
appearing on a bench by the lake at the Avengers'
upstate facility to reveal what he'd done.

00:15:59.329 --> 00:16:03.079
Now an old man who'd spent the last half of
his life happily married, he handed over his

00:16:03.079 --> 00:16:07.910
shield to Sam Wilson, making him the next
Captain America while also declining to reveal

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:10.269
any details about his married life.

00:16:10.269 --> 00:16:12.050
"You wanna tell me about her?"

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:13.760
"No.

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:16.440
No, I don't think I will."

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:20.519
The only glimpse that we, the audience get
of Steve's second chance at a normal life

00:16:20.519 --> 00:16:23.399
is the dance that Steve had promised Peggy
all those years ago.

